// Generated badge artwork — one WebP data URI per resort id.
//
// The art is pre-cropped to the badge's COLOURED FIELD: it must not carry its
// own white die-cut rim, because buildBadgeSVG still draws that itself (and two
// rims stack into a visible double ring). Resorts absent from this map fall
// back to the vector MOTIFS library in badges.js.
//
// Source: Gemini, Director-supplied, Nov 2026. Brand marks were removed before
// inclusion — a Moncler patch (vail-co), a PRADA wordmark (aspen-snowmass-co),
// a Team-USA/Under-Armour mark (copper-mountain-co), a surf-brand swoosh
// (mammoth-mountain-ca) and a Mountain Hardwear wordmark (the home sticker).
// Generated garment logos reproduce real trademarks and must never ship.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
